# Compiled/binary PDK artifacts — mark as binary so git skips end-of-line
# normalization, diff, and merge on them. (This repo does not use Git LFS;
# the largest artifact is ~39 MB, well under GitHub's per-file limit.)
*.db      binary
*.gds     binary
*.nxtgrd  binary
*.tch     binary

# Everything else (LEF, Liberty .lib, ITF, ICT, CDL, model cards, tech files,
# docs) is plain text and handled normally by git.
